<title>USA: Hughes gets Japan satellite contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes gets Japan satellite contract.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Satellite Systems Inc said Wednesday it will buy a fifth satellite from Hughes Space and Communications International Inc.</p>
<p>The satellite, an HS 601 body-stabilized model, will be delivered in November 1997 and will be used to carry voice, data and television signals to Japan, the Asia-Pacific region and Hawaii.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Hughes Space and Communications is a unit of Hughes Electronics Corp. Shares of Hughes were 3/8 higher at 54-7/8 in afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
